        "paragraphs": [
            "Tencent Hy is the model family developed by Tencent, described on these pages as built end to end by Tencent itself. Tencent says the family is organised into language models, vision language models, vision generation models and speech recognition models, and that it is offered both as open source models and through products. The open source line covers language, vision and other areas, focused on general capability building and frontier research.",
            "The language models include Hy4 preview, described as a 770B compact flagship with 1M context, updated on 2026年8月28日, and Hy3, updated on 2026年7月6日, with Hy3 Preview dated 2026年5月21日. The translation models are Hy-MT2-30B-A3B, Hy-MT2-7B and Hy-MT2-1.8B. Other listed models include HY-World 2.0, HY-1.8B-2Bit and HunyuanImage-3.0-Instruct. Tencent says Hy3 is strong in code, long text and Agent abilities, and that Hy4 preview is good at planning and execution.",
            "Tencent offers Hy through products including WorkBuddy, 元宝, ima, 腾讯文档, QQ浏览器, QQ, 腾讯搜狗输入法, 腾讯视频, 微信公众号, 腾讯新闻 and 和平精英, and through a Co-design approach with internal businesses. Tencent says internal tests show the task solving rate rising from 72% to 90% compared with Hy3 preview, with average time cut by 34%."
        ],
